UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Great Falls, Montana, 406 Processing & Taxidermy operates as a locally owned whole-animal butchery.

The facility provides year-round processing services for both wild game and livestock. During hunting season, the shop handles deer, elk, and antelope, while its livestock program offers on-ranch slaughtering—teams travel to the ranch to harvest animals and transport them back for cutting, wrapping, and specialty meat production. The taxidermy side produces European skull mounts using a beetle-cleaning method that preserves delicate bone structure, as well as full taxidermy mounts crafted by award-winning taxidermist Brad Lencioni.

The company emphasizes that every carcass is tracked so clients receive meat from their own animal, a guarantee highlighted on its about page.

Differentiators cited by the company include the guarantee of meat identity, the convenience of on-ranch slaughter, the beetle-based European mount process that avoids bone shrinkage, and the reputation of its taxidermists for trophy-quality work. Lencioni frames the business as a family-oriented operation built on trust and personal pride in each step from field to table.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Whole animal butchery", "Wild game processing (deer, elk, antelope)", "Livestock slaughter and processing", "On-ranch slaughtering", "European skull mounts (beetle cleaning)", "Taxidermy mounts"], "industries": ["Agriculture", "Hunting", "Taxidermy"], "materials": ["Wild game (deer, elk, antelope)", "Livestock (cattle, etc.)", "Bone/skulls"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Guarantee that clients receive meat from their own animal", "On-ranch slaughtering and transport to facility", "European skull mounts cleaned with beetles to preserve bone integrity", "Award-winning taxidermy by Brad Lencioni"], "facts_used": ["Location: Great Falls, Montana -> db", "Owner/operator: Dylan Lencioni (award-winning taxidermist) -> /about", "Services: whole animal butchery, wild game processing, livestock processing with on-ranch slaughtering -> /", "European skull mounts using beetle cleaning -> /", "Taxidermy by Brad Lencioni (award-winning) -> /", "Guarantee meat return from same animal -> /about", "Facility address: 900 12th Street N, Great Falls, MT 59401 -> /", "Family-oriented framing -> /about", "Customer types: farmers, ranchers, hunters -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "406 Processing & Taxidermy is a whole animal butchery that provides year around services for farmers and ranchers including processing wild game during hunting season.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance"