UPDATE companies SET description='83 Woodworks LLC is a custom cabinetry and millwork shop based in Saco, Maine. Founded in 2020 by Troy Nadeau, the business grew from a simple flower box he built for his wife; a passerby''s offer to buy it sparked the venture. Nadeau''s woodworking roots trace back to his teenage years working with his father and a vocational program in architectural design and CAD.

The shop designs, fabricates, and installs custom cabinetry for kitchens, bathrooms, home offices, closets, garage storage, and built-ins, as well as commercial millwork such as reception desks and fixtures.

Primary customers are homeowners throughout Southern Maine seeking tailored storage and architectural woodwork. Projects range from single-room built-ins to full kitchen remodels and commercial fixture packages.

