UPDATE companies SET description='A1 Graphic & Lettering operates from a 2,500-square-foot shop on the outskirts of Georgetown, Delaware. The family-owned business was founded in 2010 by Vic Thomas, who serves as owner and graphic designer, and his wife Sharon Thomas, who oversees embroidery production. What began as a mom-and-pop venture has grown into a local staple for custom apparel and signage.

