UPDATE companies SET description='AG Semiconductor Services (AGSS) is headquartered in Stamford, Connecticut. The company was founded in 1999 and has grown into a major supplier of used semiconductor manufacturing equipment.

AGSS provides remarketing services that convert surplus 150mm to 300mm manufacturing equipment into cash, handling everything from individual tools to entire fab lines. Its service portfolio includes equipment acquisition, de‑installation, decontamination, refurbishment (performed in‑house or by qualified third parties), installation, rigging, crating, transport, project management, and warranty support. The company reports having sold more than 16,000 assets to over 500 customers in 24 countries, and operates cleanroom and warehousing facilities to support refurbishment and storage.

AGSS sources most of its inventory from major fab closures and electronics manufacturers worldwide, and its sales range from single tools to complete manufacturing lines for front‑end semiconductor processing, IC test/assembly, and printed circuit board assembly.

AGSS emphasizes quality, flexibility, and availability as core drivers of its growth. Its project managers come from IDM fab backgrounds, bringing hands‑on experience with industry best‑known methods, and the company offers turnkey solutions that cover the full lifecycle from tool selection and configuration through acceptance and ongoing support.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Contract remarketing services", "Equipment acquisition", "De\u2011installation", "Decontamination and environmental compliance", "Export compliance support", "Installation", "Refurbishment (in\u2011house and third\u2011party)", "Rigging and crating", "Transport and logistics", "Turnkey project management", "Warranty support", "Project management", "Insurance coordination", "Sales of used semiconductor equipment", "Equipment inventory management", "Cleanroom and warehousing services"], "industries": ["Semiconductor manufacturing", "IC test and assembly", "Printed circuit board assembly", "Electronics manufacturing", "Fab expansion, conversion, and closure projects"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Project managers with IDM fab backgrounds", "In\u2011house refurbishment capability with third\u2011party backup", "Global sales network covering 24 countries", "Turnkey solutions from de\u2011installation to warranty", "Track record of 16,000+ assets sold to 500+ customers"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1999 -> db", "Headquarters Stamford, Connecticut -> db", "Sold 16,000+ assets to 500+ customers in 24 countries -> db", "Provides remarketing, refurbishment, installation, project management -> /services", "Project managers have IDM fab backgrounds -> /services", "Refurbishment done in-house or by qualified third-party providers -> /services", "Global customer base includes well-established and early-stage companies -> /about-us", "Quality, flexibility, availability core to growth -> /", "Offers turnkey solut