UPDATE companies SET description='AMT Computers & Electronics operates a retail store and service center in Idaho Falls, Idaho. The company opened its current location in October 2025, though the business describes its team as bringing decades of experience to custom PC assembly and repair. Ownership structure and founding year are not publicly disclosed.

