UPDATE companies SET description='AZ Wire & Cable, headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona, was founded in 1988 by Jim Anixter and Bob Zywicki, both veterans of Anixter International. The partners recognized an opportunity to supply hard‑to‑find wire and cable items—typically burdened by high manufacturer minimums and slow inventory turns—to electrical distributors of all sizes. They launched the business by leveraging their manufacturer relationships to buy special constructions, overstocks, and discontinued commodities.

Today the company operates as a master distributor of industrial, commercial, and specialty wire and cable, stocking a full range of standard and custom constructions across nine regional distribution centers nationwide. Its $65 million inventory is sold in bulk reels or cut to length, supported by value‑added services that include stripping, paralleling and Wemco processing, coiling, cut‑to‑length bundling, shrink‑wrap packaging, blind shipments, and same‑day shipping with no cut, reel, or minimum‑order charges.

AZ Wire & Cable serves the electrical distribution channel and associated markets across industrial, commercial, residential, and utility sectors. Industrial customers in steel, pulp and paper, manufacturing, energy, agriculture, and transportation rely on cables such as Type W, DLO, and VFD; commercial projects use THHN, MC, and category cable; residential applications include NM‑B, SER, and landscape lighting; utilities specify ACSR, quadraplex, and medium‑voltage cable. The company also supplies automotive and marine cable.

The founders built the business on a simple philosophy: focus on inventory depth, service responsiveness, and client value. That approach, combined with a diverse stock and nationwide logistics, is why hundreds of companies across dozens of industries turn to AZ Wire & Cable for hard‑to‑source wire and cable solutions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Paralleling & Wemco Services", "Stripping Services", "Coiling \u2013 Cut to Length & Bundling", "Shrink Wrap & Special Packaging", "Blind Shipments", "Same Day Shipping", "Will Call Pickup", "No Cut Charge", "No Reel Charge", "No Minimum Order Charge"], "industries": ["Automotive & Marine Cable", "Industrial", "Commercial", "Residential", "Utilities", "Steel", "Pulp & Paper", "Manufacturing", "Energy", "Agriculture", "Transportation"], "materials": ["Copper", "Aluminum"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping on stocked items", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day shipping on stocked items", "No cut, reel, or minimum-order charges", "Paralleling and Wemco processing services", "Stripping, coiling, and cut-to-length bundling", "Nine regional distribution centers nationwide"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1988 by Jim Anixter and Bob Zywicki -> /about", "Headquarters Phoenix, Arizona -> db", "Nine regional distribution centers -> /about", "$65 million inventory -> /services", "Services: stripping, paralleling, coiling, cut-to-length, shrink wrap, blind shipments, same-day shipping, no cut/reel/minimum charges -> /services", "Industries: industrial, commercial, residential, utilities, automotive & marine -> /, /about", "Materials: copper, aluminum -> /", "Same-day shipping on stocked items -> /services", "No minimum order -> /services", "Company type: master distributor -> /about", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "AZ Wire & Cable is a leading master distributor for industrial, commercial & specialt