UPDATE companies SET description='Absolute Medical Equipment Sales, based in New York, New York, has been a supplier of refurbished medical equipment since 2001. The company operates as Absolute Medical Services, Inc., and maintains a small-business approach despite serving an international customer base.

The company specializes in the refurbishment and resale of pre-owned medical devices, including ultrasound machines and probes, defibrillators, patient monitors, infusion pumps, bone densitometers, and EKG machines. Each unit undergoes a refurbishing process certified to original equipment manufacturer standards. Absolute Medical also operates a biomedical and service division staffed by certified sonographers and nurses, offering replacement, loaner, and rental equipment with same-day delivery for customers in the New York metropolitan area.

Its customers range from large hospital systems and university medical centers to specialized clinics, surgery centers, and private practices. The company has supplied equipment to institutions such as Montefiore Medical Center, vein centers, cardiac care and vascular medicine practices, and international buyers in Australia and New Zealand.

