UPDATE companies SET description='Accutron, based in Windsor, Connecticut, was established in 1989 as a contract manufacturer specializing in printed circuit board assembly. In September 2024, the company became part of Foxtronics EMS, a move intended to broaden its capabilities and increase its visibility in the electronics industry.

