UPDATE companies SET description='Advanced Custom Metals Inc (ACM) operates from Des Plaines, Illinois, providing precision metal fabrication and welding services to industrial and commercial clients. The company focuses on laser cutting and welding using 3-axis machinery, though its founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

