UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1993 near Wright-Patterson Air Force Base in Dayton, Ohio, Advanced Wire and Cable is a woman-owned distributor specializing in military, aerospace, and commercial wire, cable, tubing, and electronic products.

The company maintains an extensive inventory of mil-spec, high-temperature, and specialty wire and cable, along with protective tubing, sleeving, and electronic components for defense and aerospace applications. Services include same-day shipping on most in-stock orders placed before 2 PM EST, part-number cross-referencing for active and obsolete items, hazardous-material shipping compliant with DOT and IATA regulations, and custom sourcing for hard-to-find parts. Technical consultation and live phone support are provided without automated menus.

Advanced Wire and Cable serves military, aerospace, defense, and commercial customers nationwide, including prime defense contractors and aerospace manufacturers. Its customer base spans organizations that require compliance with stringent military and aerospace specifications.

The business was established to meet the specialized needs of aerospace and defense contractors for reliable, precision components. Its leadership emphasizes that certifications such as AS9120 and ISO 9001 reflect a commitment to quality and safety, while woman-owned status offers procurement teams tax-incentive opportunities and supports diversity goals.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9120','ISO 9001','WBENC']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Distribution of military, aerospace, and commercial wire, cable, tubing, and electronic components", "Same-day shipping", "Part number cross-referencing", "Hazardous material shipping (DOT/IATA)", "Special orders and custom sourcing", "Technical consultation", "Live phone support", "Credit card processing with no fees"], "industries": ["Military", "Aerospace", "Defense", "Commercial", "Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping for in-stock orders placed before 2 PM EST", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day shipping on most in-stock orders placed before 2 PM EST", "Extensive cross-reference database for active and obsolete part numbers", "Hazardous-material shipping with DOT/IATA compliance", "Live person phone support with no automated menus", "WBENC-certified woman-owned business supporting supplier diversity"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1993 near Wright-Patterson Air Force Base in Dayton, Ohio -> /about", "Woman-owned distributor -> /", "WBENC-certified -> /about", "AS9120 and ISO 9001 certified -> /about", "Same-day shipping on most in-stock orders before 2 PM EST -> /services", "Part number cross-referencing for active and obsolete parts -> /services", "Hazardous material shipping with DOT/IATA compliance -> /services", "Live person phone support -> /services", "Serves military, aerospace, defense, and commercial customers nationwide -> /about", "Specializes in sourcing hard-to-find and obsolete parts -> /", "No credit card processing fees -> /services", "Headquarter