UPDATE companies SET description='Advantest America Inc. is headquartered in New York, New York, and operates as the United States subsidiary of Advantest Corporation, which was founded in 1954 in Tokyo. The Japanese parent company began as a pioneer in electronic measurement and has grown into a global supplier of semiconductor test equipment. The U.S. entity supports sales, service, and engineering for the North American market.

The company designs and manufactures automated test equipment (ATE) for semiconductor production. Its product portfolio includes system-on-chip (SoC) test platforms such as the V93000 EXA Scale, memory test systems like the T5801 for ultra-high-speed DRAM, component test systems, metrology and scanning electron microscopy tools, and software solutions including the ACS Gemini digital twin platform and the SiConic unified test development ecosystem. Advantest also provides customer support services worldwide.

Advantest serves the semiconductor industry and broader electronics sector. Recent collaborations highlight work in silicon photonics with OpenLight, power semiconductor test with the MTe platform, and high-performance AI memory devices with the M5241 handler. The company participates in major industry events such as SEMICON West, SEMICON India, SEMICON Taiwan, and the International Test Conference.

